 <div class="py-3 flex items-center text-sm text-stone-800 before:flex-1 before:border-t before:border-stone-200 before:me-6 after:flex-1 after:border-t after:border-stone-200 after:ms-6 dark:text-neutral-200 dark:before:border-neutral-600 dark:after:border-neutral-600">Cowrie Medical Services</div>

